Package: ARSPI
Type: Package
Title: ARSPI - A Tool for Estimating AutoRegressive SPI and Drought Characteristics
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: person("Soham", "Ghosh", email = "phd2001161004@iiti.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to estimate the AutoRegressive Standardized Precipitation Index (ARSPI)
    using a Bayesian hierarchical model with MCMC via JAGS. Also includes tools to evaluate and analyze 
    drought characteristics including duration, severity, intensity, and classification agreement 
    using the Integrated Drought Classification Matrix (IDCM), Drought Impact Proportion (DIP), 
    and categorical summaries. Useful for hydroclimatic risk analysis and drought monitoring at various time scales.
